	(text "SIROKKO 262.01 - COMMON CONTROLLER INTERFACES / DRAFT\nESP32-S3-DevKitC-1-N8R8 v1.1; J1 and J3 numbers follow the Espressif Header Block.\nNative KiCad project. This sheet is NOT the complete heater wiring or a manufacturing release."
	(at 25.4 25.4 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
		(justify left)
	)
	(uuid "f1705f73-79aa-4f8d-8ed6-9f68bf3391e7")
)
	(text "EXTERNAL SENSOR MODULES\nJ10/J11 pin order is OUR HARNESS, not the manufacturer's header order.\n1 Vin=3V3; 2 GND; 3 SCK; 4 SDO; 5 SDI; 6 CS; 7 DRDY.\nK probes connect to T+/T- of each external module, not to this logic board."
	(at 25.4 42.672 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
		(justify left)
	)
	(uuid "798c3819-deea-418d-a655-a27ceac4b24e")
)
	(text "EXTERNAL POWER AND SAFETY STAGES\nJ20/J21 carry 3V3 LOGIC ONLY. NO 24V, coil or motor current here.\nFUEL_PERMIT must pass through independent watchdog + latched limit chain.\nSTOP must also break the external fuel permission directly.\nProtective fuel/glow disconnects and fan off-delay are not implemented on this sheet."
	(at 142.24 137.16 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
		(justify left)
	)
	(uuid "a32d2430-92f6-4b14-b073-bf061508d25a")
)
	(text "POWER / ROOM SENSOR\nJ13: externally regulated +5V only, never raw 24V.\nDo not combine USB and external supply without verified power isolation.\nJ12 harness: 1 VDD=3V3; 2 DQ; 3 GND. Actual DS18B20 package pinout differs."
	(at 25.4 175.26 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
		(justify left)
	)
	(uuid "a26a683b-7ac9-4a62-9c63-46d72f52b918")
)
	(text "R1: ROOM PULL-UP. R2/R3: SPI CS PULL-UPS. R4-R12: DEFINED LOW / DISCONNECTED SAFETY STATUS.\nNC flags mean intentionally unused external DevKit connections, not deleted checks.\nRev A: SPEED_CMD selects low speed through a non-overlapping changeover contact.\nRev B: SPEED_CMD is PWM; low-speed motor lead is isolated; independent full-speed purge path required.\nERC checks this interface network only; it cannot verify combustion, external modules or protective timing."
	(at 25.4 269.24 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
		(justify left)
	)
	(uuid "5da8c089-5e3e-4b0a-bcf2-bfc0b44e5dce")
)
	(text "HARDWARE FUEL PERMISSION — DRAFT / NO FIRED OPERATION\nU2.1: fault-dominant allow latch. U2.2: SPDT RESET debounce.\nRESET: momentary DPDT, break-before-make; hardware pole J24 COM/NC/NO; isolated second pole -> GPIO6 RESET_REQUEST/GND.\nU7 supervises +3V3 (G33 = 3.08 V nominal); watchdog recovery alone CANNOT re-arm.\nJ21 SAFETY_OK is now a MONITOR OUTPUT. Never drive it externally or bridge to +3V3."
	(at 210.82 279.4 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "0efdce91-6b1b-4bc4-9ca6-cddffc2f92e4")
)
	(text "J24: 1=GND/COM, 2=NC_N, 3=NO_N. Never short NC_N to NO_N. Both LOW is forbidden for U2.2.\nJ25: 1=+3V3, 2=THERMAL_OK, 3=GND, 4=EXT_SAFETY_ENABLE. 3V3 ONLY — NOT A COIL DRIVER.\nTHERMAL_OK: isolated contact closed to +3V3 when healthy; R22 pulls LOW on open wire.\nExternal STOP and independent thermal limit MUST ALSO directly interrupt the protective contactor coil circuit.\nOutput buffering, physical fuel disconnection, independent post-purge, layout and bench validation remain pending."
	(at 238.76 403.86 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "ffac4b6b-0c63-418a-89b3-ece37d5ecc0e")
)
	(text "DRAFT_NOT_FOR_ORDER: LM5013 +5V output is intentionally OPEN at root. No connection to DevKit 5V/VIN until USB reverse-feed arbitration is proven on the exact v1.1 board."
	(at 430 35 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "33efe872-0624-43e1-a6dd-3bb54058eb20")
)
